{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "refda-api-v1",
    "name": "Refda API",
    "description": "Refda (رفدة) — Saudi social gifting backend.\n\n## Setup\n1. Start Postgres: `docker compose up -d postgres`\n2. Run API: `make run`\n3. Collection variables are pre-filled for local dev.\n\n## Dev credentials\n- **Phone:** `+966501234567`\n- **OTP:** `1234` (fixed in `config.yaml` → `otp.mock_fixed_code`)\n- **Admin key:** `12345` (header `X-Admin-Key`)\n\n## Recommended flow (run in order)\n1. **Auth → Login** → **Verify OTP** (saves `token`)\n2. **Events → Create Event** (status `pending_review`, saves `eventId`, `giftId`)\n3. **Admin → Approve Event** (status `open`)\n4. **Gifts → Contribute** → **Pay** (repeat until 100% collected)\n5. **Events → Get Event By ID** (status `collected`)\n6. **Events → Withdraw** (partial then full → `partial_withdrawn` / `fully_withdrawn`)\n\n## Event statuses\n`pending_review` → `open` → `collected` → `partial_withdrawn` → `fully_withdrawn`\n\nContributions are only accepted when status is `open`.\nWithdrawals only when status is `collected` or `partial_withdrawn`.\n\n## Response envelope\n`{ \"success\": true|false, \"data\"?: ..., \"error\"?: { \"code\", \"message\", \"message_ar\" } }`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080" },
    { "key": "phone", "value": "+966501234567" },
    { "key": "registerPhone", "value": "+966509876543" },
    { "key": "otp", "value": "1234", "description": "Fixed dev OTP (config.yaml mock_fixed_code)" },
    { "key": "adminKey", "value": "12345", "description": "X-Admin-Key header value" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "userId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "eventId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "giftId", "value": "", "description": "Product gift ID from Create Event" },
    { "key": "giftCashId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "contributionId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "withdrawalId", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('success', () => pm.expect(j.success).to.eql(true));",
                  "pm.test('service refda-api', () => pm.expect(j.data.service).to.eql('refda-api'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Send OTP)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('OTP sent', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(j.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(j.data.message).to.eql('OTP sent');",
                  "});",
                  "console.log('Dev OTP is always: ' + pm.collectionVariables.get('otp'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login",
            "description": "Sends OTP to an existing or new phone. Accepts +9665XXXXXXXX, 05XXXXXXXX, or 5XXXXXXXX.\n\nDev: OTP is always `1234` (see config.yaml)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Register (Send OTP)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('OTP sent', () => pm.expect(j.success).to.eql(true));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{registerPhone}}\",\n  \"full_name\": \"سارة علي\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register",
            "description": "Fails with USER_EXISTS if phone is already registered. Use a new `registerPhone` for first-time signup."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify OTP",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('JWT issued', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(j.success).to.eql(true);",
                  "  pm.expect(j.data.token).to.be.a('string');",
                  "});",
                  "if (j.data && j.data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.data.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', j.data.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{phone}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{otp}}\",\n  \"full_name\": \"أحمد محمد\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify",
            "description": "`full_name` is required only when creating a new user via Login flow.\n\nDev OTP: `1234` (4 digits)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Verify OTP (Register flow)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (j.data && j.data.token) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('token', j.data.token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('userId', j.data.user.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"phone\": \"{{registerPhone}}\",\n  \"code\": \"{{otp}}\",\n  \"full_name\": \"سارة علي\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/verify"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
